      "headline": {
        "en": "Endowus launches first European direct lending strategy with CVC backing",
        "zh": "Endowus 与 CVC 合作推出首个欧洲直接贷款策略"
      },
      "summary": {
        "en": "Asian wealth manager Endowus has launched its first standalone European direct lending strategy, backed by private markets firm CVC, and open to investors in Singapore and Hong Kong. Endowus said the partnership gives its clients access to European private credit beyond the US, citing CVC's EUR 52bn credit platform.",
        "zh": "亚洲财富管理公司 Endowus 推出了其首个独立欧洲直接贷款策略，由私募市场公司 CVC 支持，面向新加坡和香港投资者开放。Endowus 表示，此次合作使其客户能够获得美国以外的欧洲私人信贷敞口，并提及其 CVC 旗下 520 亿欧元信贷平台。"
      },
